# TRD §3.1 — exclude build artifacts, test projects, version control, and docs
# from the Docker build context so COPY . . does not bust layer cache or
# include unnecessary files in the image.

# VCS and IDE
**/.git
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/.idea

# Build outputs (dotnet restore/publish writes to obj/ and bin/ inside the container)
**/bin/
**/obj/

# Test projects and results
tests/
**/TestResults/

# Documentation and development-only files
**.md
docs/
*.md

# User secrets and environment-specific overrides
**/appsettings.*.json
!**/appsettings.json
!**/appsettings.Development.json

# NuGet local cache
**/.nuget/
